@CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..oOeGKKyGxN_l1kfdpxOn0558vH1a5ZKrNAdZjlRbQxA
@certificateId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
@userId = 36bc8881-a786-432f-b5de-bca03f8193ba
@pageIndex = 0
@pageSize = 10

### 1. Create Certificate - Tworzenie nowego certyfikatu
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "ownerName": "Kamil Matusz",
  "title": "Certyfikat ukończenia kursu Blockchain Developer",
  "issuedBy": "Uniwersytet Techniczny",
  "issuedDate": "2025-01-02T10:00:00.000Z",
  "blockchain": "Polygon"
}

### 2. Create Certificate - Przykład z Ethereum
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "ownerName": "Anna Kowalska",
  "title": "Certyfikat AI & Machine Learning",
  "issuedBy": "Tech Academy",
  "issuedDate": "2025-01-02T12:30:00.000Z",
  "blockchain": "Ethereum"
}

### 3. Create Certificate - Przykład z datą przeszłą
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "ownerName": "Jan Nowak",
  "title": "Dyplom Magistra Informatyki",
  "issuedBy": "Politechnika Warszawska",
  "issuedDate": "2024-06-15T14:00:00.000Z",
  "blockchain": "Polygon"
}

### 4. Get Certificate by ID - Pobranie certyfikatu po ID
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/{{certificateId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 5. Get All Certificates - Wszystkie certyfikaty (bez paginacji)
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getAllCertificates
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Certificates with Pagination - Certyfikaty z paginacją
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificates?pageIndex={{pageIndex}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Certificates with Pagination - Druga strona
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificates?pageIndex=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Certificates with Pagination - Bez parametrów (domyślne)
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificates
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Certificates by User ID - Certyfikaty konkretnego użytkownika
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificatesByUserId/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 10. Get Certificates by User ID - Przykład z innym userId
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificatesByUserId/test-user-123
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 11. Delete Certificate - Usunięcie certyfikatu
DELETE {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/{{certificateId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 12. Delete Certificate - Usunięcie innego certyfikatu (przykład)
DELETE {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Test 1: Tworzenie certyfikatu bez autoryzacji (powinno zwrócić 401)
POST {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Test User",
  "title": "Test Certificate",
  "issuedBy": "Test Issuer",
  "issuedDate": "2025-01-02T10:00:00.000Z",
  "blockchain": "Polygon"
}

### Test 2: Pobieranie nieistniejącego certyfikatu (powinno zwrócić 404)
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Test 3: Pobieranie certyfikatów nieistniejącego użytkownika
GET {{CertiBlock.Services.Certificates.Api_HostAddress}}/certificate-service/Certificates/getCertificatesByUserId/nonexistent-user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

